    "category_specific_evidence": [
      "Property: with an explicit mask, masked entries should be excluded from the variance (numerator and denominator) under skipna=True, and should propagate NA under skipna=False. Before the fix, the mask only affected the denominator under skipna=False.",
      "Test: with skipna=True, masked rows drop out of both numerator and denominator, so nanvar/nanstd/nansem on values with mask must equal the same call on values["
